flowchart LR
    PR[Pull request]
    Secrets[Gitleaks]
    SAST[Semgrep]
    SCA[Composer/npm audit<br/>WPScan]
    IaC[Checkov + tfsec<br/>Kubesec]
    Image[Build targets PHP/Nginx]
    Trivy[Trivy<br/>0 CRITICAL con fix]
    Publish[Artifact Registry<br/>digest inmutable]
    WIF[GitHub OIDC → WIF]
    Gateway[GKE Connect Gateway]
    Deploy[Rollout en GKE]
    Smoke[ZAP baseline + HTTP smoke]

    PR --> Secrets --> SAST --> SCA --> IaC --> Image --> Trivy
    Trivy -->|solo main y gates verdes| Publish
    WIF --> Gateway --> Deploy
    Publish --> Deploy --> Smoke
